rota lap 4419, row 4 -- Earth, the row that breathes in. What it surfaced: the row asks for the concrete fact at the door before the argument about it, so the lap read the manifest against the tree rather than the sentence about the manifest -- and the fact at the door was one absent line.
file SOURCE.md the seed reader is pointed at a template that ships, rather than a room that does not
